.DS_Store
._*

# Local workspace folders; GitHub publishes archives from app_archives/.
.claude/
art_samples/
config/
development/
docs/
for_human_review_apps/

# Root-level local notes/packages.
/AGENTS.md
/APP_DESCRIPTIONS.md
/*.zip
/*.txt

# Do not publish nested local git histories as app sources.
**/.git/
.local_app_git_backups/

# Local build and IDE output.
**/build/
**/DerivedData/
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/*.xcuserdatad/

# Xcode transient files.
**/*.moved-aside
**/*.xcscmblueprint
**/*.xccheckout
